{"seq":2,"slug":"shared-inventory-oversell-guard","title":"共享库存与跨平台超卖防护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multichannel-seller-erp-connector/aggregate-order-inventory/shared-inventory-oversell-guard","wordCount":2309,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"共享库存与跨平台超卖防护\">共享库存与跨平台超卖防护</h1><p>仓库里 37 件，六个渠道都能卖。理想状态下，第一个渠道卖掉 30 件之后，剩下五个渠道应该在几十秒内看到 7。现实是：卖出的那一刻只有我们的系统知道，五个平台的库存数字还是 37；等我们把 7 推下去，平台侧可能还要几分钟才生效；而在生效之前的这几分钟里，另外两个渠道各卖掉了 5 件。超卖发生了，赔付、差评、渠道罚分随之而来。</p>\n<p>这件事的工程本质不是「分配算法」，而是<strong>不可逆动作与延迟可见状态之间的竞争</strong>。平台侧的下单动作是不可逆的（买家付款就成单），而我们对平台库存数字的修改有一个生效延迟窗口。任何在这个窗口内基于旧数字的决策都会超卖。所以防护的目标不是把超卖概率降到零（在纯异步链路上不可能），而是把它降到可接受水平，并让剩余的超卖可被检测、可被处置。</p>\n<p>本篇讲三个机制：预留（reserve）怎么表达与原子化、写入时序怎么安排（何时降、何时升、用什么数字）、以及写失败与写丢失时的补偿路径。库存数字的<strong>分配来源</strong>（多仓调拨、安全库存、渠道配额）属于独立的库存中台职责；本篇只处理「拿到可用量之后怎么安全地告诉各平台」。价格/库存推送的通用去抖与配额机制见 <a href=\"../cross-listing-sync/cross-channel-price-stock-sync\">跨渠道价格/库存同步</a>，本篇专注其中的安全边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先把三个数字分开，混在一起用是超卖的根源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数字</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>谁写</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>on_hand</code></td>\n<td>物理在库数量</td>\n<td>WMS/入库</td>\n<td>不可直接对外</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>available</code></td>\n<td>可售数量 = <code>on_hand</code> - 已预留 - 安全库存</td>\n<td>库存中台</td>\n<td>分配与对外的基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>published[c]</code></td>\n<td>已推给渠道 c 的数字</td>\n<td>同步引擎</td>\n<td>该渠道当前看到的值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>超卖发生在 <code>published[c] &gt; available</code> 的时刻。因为平台上的买家按 <code>published[c]</code> 下单，一旦真实 <code>available</code> 已经低于它，后续订单就无法满足。防护的所有手段都可以归结为一句话：<strong>让 <code>published</code> 尽量贴近但永不高于 <code>available</code>，并在这个约束下最大化可售性</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单支付成功] --&gt; B[事务内: on_hand 与 available 递减]&#10;  B --&gt; C[写 outbox: 需要下调 published]&#10;  C --&gt; D[同步引擎立即下发下调]&#10;  D --&gt; E{写入成功?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[published 更新&lt;br/&gt;记录 submitted_at]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[重试预算内重排]&#10;  G --&gt; H[预算耗尽 → 差异队列]&#10;  F --&gt; I[生效延迟窗口&lt;br/&gt;按渠道分布估计]&#10;  I --&gt; J[回查确认真实生效]&#10;  J --&gt;|仍不一致| H&#10;  B -.-&gt;|并发渠道订单| K[同一事务的乐观锁重试]\">graph TD\n  A[订单支付成功] --&gt; B[事务内: on_hand 与 available 递减]\n  B --&gt; C[写 outbox: 需要下调 published]\n  C --&gt; D[同步引擎立即下发下调]\n  D --&gt; E{写入成功?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[published 更新&lt;br/&gt;记录 submitted_at]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[重试预算内重排]\n  G --&gt; H[预算耗尽 → 差异队列]\n  F --&gt; I[生效延迟窗口&lt;br/&gt;按渠道分布估计]\n  I --&gt; J[回查确认真实生效]\n  J --&gt;|仍不一致| H\n  B -.-&gt;|并发渠道订单| K[同一事务的乐观锁重试]</pre><h2 id=\"预留的原子性\">预留的原子性</h2><p>订单支付成功到库存扣减之间，必须有且只有一次原子操作。不要写「先查 available，判断够不够，再更新」——这在并发下必然超卖。可行做法有二：数据库层的条件更新，或行锁加事务。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 方案 A：条件更新，靠 WHERE 子句保证不会负库存&#10;UPDATE inventory&#10;   SET on_hand   = on_hand - $1,&#10;       available = available - $1,&#10;       version   = version + 1&#10; WHERE sku_id = $2&#10;   AND available &gt;= $1;&#10;-- 影响行数为 0 表示库存不足，业务侧必须走缺货流程而不是重试\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 方案 A：条件更新，靠 WHERE 子句保证不会负库存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> on_hand   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> on_hand </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 影响行数为 0 表示库存不足，业务侧必须走缺货流程而不是重试</span></span></code></pre></div><p>方案 A 的优点是单语句、无显式锁、自带「不足即失败」语义；缺点是并发高时失败率高，需要业务侧处理失败分支。方案 B 是用 <code>SELECT ... FOR UPDATE</code> 显式加锁：PostgreSQL 的文档说明 <code>SELECT FOR UPDATE</code> 会阻塞其它事务对同一行的 <code>UPDATE</code>/<code>DELETE</code>/<code>FOR UPDATE</code>，并会在当前事务结束前一直保持锁，同时它也是死锁的常见来源——两个事务以不同顺序锁多行就会互相等待（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/explicit-locking.html\">Explicit Locking</a>）。所以方案 B 只有在<strong>多行同时锁定且顺序固定</strong>时才安全（例如按 <code>sku_id</code> 升序锁）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>并发表现</th>\n<th>死锁风险</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>条件更新（<code>WHERE available &gt;= n</code>）</td>\n<td>高竞争时失败率上升</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>单行扣减，推荐默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SELECT FOR UPDATE</code> + 计算</td>\n<td>串行化，吞吐受锁持有时长限制</td>\n<td>有（多行乱序）</td>\n<td>需要跨行校验的组合扣减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乐观锁（version 比较）</td>\n<td>冲突时重试</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>读多写少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事务 + <code>SERIALIZABLE</code></td>\n<td>冲突时序列化失败需重试</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>需要跨多行的强一致校验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>SERIALIZABLE</code> 的代价必须说清：PostgreSQL 的实现会在检测到可能导致序列化异常的并发时让其中一个事务失败，<strong>应用必须准备重试</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/transaction-iso.html\">Transaction Isolation</a>）。把 <code>SERIALIZABLE</code> 用在库存扣减上是把一个并发问题转成了重试问题，只有当业务不变式确实跨多行时才值得。</p>\n<h3 id=\"预留必须有生命周期\">预留必须有生命周期</h3><p>预留不能只加不减。每条预留记录必须有：订单标识、数量、创建时刻、过期时刻、以及状态（<code>held</code>/<code>committed</code>/<code>released</code>）。订单取消或超时未支付时预留必须被释放；订单发货时预留转为 <code>committed</code> 并从 <code>on_hand</code> 真正扣走。没有过期释放，未支付订单会永久占用库存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"写入时序-何时降-何时升\">写入时序：何时降、何时升</h2><p>库存写入的时序策略决定了超卖率与可售率这对矛盾的天平。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>时效</th>\n<th>数字取什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>订单支付成功</td>\n<td>立即下调</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>新的 <code>available</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订单取消/退款入库</td>\n<td>延迟上调</td>\n<td>30 秒–数分钟</td>\n<td>新的 <code>available</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>补货入库</td>\n<td>延迟上调</td>\n<td>按计划</td>\n<td>新的 <code>available</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存盘点修正</td>\n<td>人工确认后</td>\n<td>手动触发</td>\n<td>盘点值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道临时限售</td>\n<td>立即下调</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>0 或限售上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"为什么要留安全裕量\">为什么要留安全裕量</h3><p>即使下调是秒级的，从「我们发出下调请求」到「平台侧生效」有一个窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（按渠道不同）。在这个窗口内，该渠道仍按旧数字接单，所以理论超卖上界是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_c \\le \\lambda_c \\cdot L_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该渠道的下单速率（件/秒），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是生效延迟。要让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降到可接受水平，有两个可调项：压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（提高回查频率、用更快的更新通道），或在发布给渠道的数字上留裕量，即发布值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= \\max(0, available - m_c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 覆盖窗口内的期望销量。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不是拍出来的：它应该由历史数据估计的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与实测的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 计算得到，并且在大促时按倍数放大。这个裕量的代价是「少卖」，所以它只应该在高风险的渠道与高风险的 SKU 上启用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"大促时的收缩策略\">大促时的收缩策略</h3><p>大促开始前要主动把所有渠道的 <code>published</code> 收缩到一个保守值，并在活动期间<strong>暂停上调</strong>——只允许下调，不允许上调。原因是活动期间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 会放大数倍，上调带来的可售性收益远小于超卖风险。活动结束、订单流回落后再恢复正常的双向同步，并对活动期间的超卖做一次统计（这一统计进入 <a href=\"../erp-ops-reconcile/multichannel-performance-dashboard\">跨平台经营效果看板</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"写失败与写丢失的补偿\">写失败与写丢失的补偿</h2><p>同步写入会失败，失败之后的三条路径必须明确。</p>\n<p>第一条是<strong>可重试失败</strong>（429、5xx）：进入重试编排，退避与配额规则见 <a href=\"../channel-connector-arch/channel-auth-api-quota\">各平台授权与 API 限流适配</a>。关键约束是：下调的重试<strong>不能延期</strong>——一条超时的下调意味着超卖窗口被拉长，所以下调任务应该占用高优先级预留配额。</p>\n<p>第二条是<strong>永久失败</strong>（平台拒绝、商品不存在）：进入差异队列，同时触发一个<strong>本地侧的保守动作</strong>——把该渠道标记为「库存不可信」，在修复前不再向其发布数字，并按最坏情况（0）处理可以降低超卖。这条动作很重要，因为一个不可信却仍在售的渠道是超卖的主要来源。</p>\n<p>第三条是<strong>结果未知</strong>（超时）：必须走对账而不是重试。对账方式是按商品详情回查真实值并覆盖本地 <code>published</code>，机制见 <a href=\"../cross-listing-sync/listing-status-reconcile\">各平台上架状态回查对账</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用幂等键让下调可安全重放\">用幂等键让下调可安全重放</h3><p>下调与上调都必须是幂等的，否则重放会把库存改错。可行的做法是让每次写入携带一个由 <code>(sku, channel, target_value, version)</code> 合成的幂等键，平台侧不支持幂等键时则在本地记录「最后一次成功写入的版本」，只允许更高版本的写入通过。这与 <a href=\"../cross-listing-sync/cross-channel-price-stock-sync\">跨渠道价格/库存同步</a> 里分片串行队列用到的版本号是同一个机制，不要另造一套。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超卖的事后处置\">超卖的事后处置</h2><p>即使做了上面的全部防护，超卖仍会发生。超卖被检测到时（通常来自「同一 SKU 的订单数超过 <code>on_hand</code>」这类守恒检查），处置顺序是：先确认哪些订单受影响、再决定保哪一单（通常保最早支付的）、对无法履约的订单走主动取消与赔偿流程、最后把这次超卖归因（是延迟窗口、是写失败、还是分配错误）并写进事件记录。归因的价值在于它能告诉你下一步该加固哪一环——没有归因，所有的加固都是猜测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分开 <code>on_hand</code>/<code>available</code>/<code>published</code> 三个数字；防护目标是最小化 <code>published &gt; available</code> 的持续时间与幅度。</li>\n<li>库存扣减用条件更新保证不会负库存；显式行锁只在多行固定顺序时安全，<code>SERIALIZABLE</code> 会把并发问题转成重试问题。</li>\n<li>预留必须有生命周期与过期释放；下调立即、上调延迟；用实测的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 计算安全裕量而不是拍数字。</li>\n<li>大促期间只降不升；写失败分可重试、永久失败、结果未知三路，永久失败要立即把该渠道标记为库存不可信。</li>\n<li>写入必须幂等（版本号或平台幂等键）；超卖事后必须归因，否则加固方向无从确定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"共享库存与跨平台超卖防护","id":"共享库存与跨平台超卖防护"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"预留的原子性","id":"预留的原子性"},{"level":3,"text":"预留必须有生命周期","id":"预留必须有生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"写入时序：何时降、何时升","id":"写入时序-何时降-何时升"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么要留安全裕量","id":"为什么要留安全裕量"},{"level":3,"text":"大促时的收缩策略","id":"大促时的收缩策略"},{"level":2,"text":"写失败与写丢失的补偿","id":"写失败与写丢失的补偿"},{"level":3,"text":"用幂等键让下调可安全重放","id":"用幂等键让下调可安全重放"},{"level":2,"text":"超卖的事后处置","id":"超卖的事后处置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"跨平台订单聚合与去重","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multichannel-seller-erp-connector/aggregate-order-inventory/cross-platform-order-aggregate"},"next":{"title":"发货/轨迹回写各平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multichannel-seller-erp-connector/aggregate-order-inventory/fulfillment-shipment-writeback"}}